purpose:
CPD met with a group of businesses to update on COP26 priorities and progress on planning for the Summit; highlight ways businesses can support COP26, including sign up to Race to Zero; 
highlight the importance of Government and business collaboration for a lasting COP26 legacy that drives net zero objectives.

List of businesses invited: Uber, EDF, Heathrow, Mitie, Southern water, Biffa ,Fidelity international, Associated British Ports, Diageo, Johnson Matthey, Porterbrook, O2

